00:24:44.490 --> 00:24:47.250
I would say social media for me personally

00:24:47.250 --> 00:24:50.290
has for the most part been a
positive effect on my life.

00:24:50.290 --> 00:24:52.840
Obviously the early days of Khan Academy,

00:24:52.840 --> 00:24:54.500
people think Khan Academy
started with videos.

00:24:54.500 --> 00:24:56.780
We actually started with
this little software platform

00:24:56.780 --> 00:24:58.600
that I was running for my cousins

00:24:58.600 --> 00:25:02.220
and I made videos to
supplement that software.

00:25:02.220 --> 00:25:04.460
But obviously having,
if you consider YouTube

00:25:04.460 --> 00:25:05.770
to be a social media platform,

00:25:05.770 --> 00:25:07.970
having a place where I could publish

00:25:07.970 --> 00:25:10.980
and people discover
allowed people to discover

00:25:10.980 --> 00:25:13.120
Khan Academy allowed
some of the first funders

00:25:13.120 --> 00:25:15.100
to realize that this was
an effort worth doing.

00:25:15.100 --> 00:25:17.790
So I think, Khan Academy
has been from that

00:25:17.790 --> 00:25:19.750
we obviously still levered
social media a lot.

00:25:19.750 --> 00:25:21.060
We're doing it right now.

00:25:21.060 --> 00:25:23.740
But I would also say that I'm fortunate

00:25:23.740 --> 00:25:25.740
and I do consider myself fortunate that,

00:25:26.970 --> 00:25:29.310
I didn't in the same way
grow up with social media.

00:25:29.310 --> 00:25:31.590
I could imagine the things
that Jim is talking about

00:25:31.590 --> 00:25:34.130
when you're 12, 13 years old, 14 year old,

00:25:34.130 --> 00:25:35.660
or you're a 10 year old
with a fake account,

00:25:35.660 --> 00:25:37.750
pretending you're 13 years old.

00:25:37.750 --> 00:25:40.340
That it can put a lot of pressure on you

00:25:40.340 --> 00:25:42.050
to try to be something you're not,

00:25:42.050 --> 00:25:44.770
or when your frontal lobe
isn't fully developed,

00:25:44.770 --> 00:25:47.680
you might be putting things
out there into the world,

00:25:47.680 --> 00:25:50.477
that later you might be not so proud of.

00:25:50.477 --> 00:25:51.530
And it's good.

00:25:51.530 --> 00:25:55.080
It's good that for a lot
