00:27:01.226 --> 00:27:05.233
Me, I'm not a big user
of social media myself.

00:27:06.940 --> 00:27:08.640
It's all about how you use it.

00:27:08.640 --> 00:27:10.140
It's like life.

00:27:10.140 --> 00:27:12.690
If you use it wisely and
in balance and moderation,

00:27:12.690 --> 00:27:13.580
use it for the good thing.

00:27:13.580 --> 00:27:15.560
Social media can be incredible.

00:27:15.560 --> 00:27:17.970
If you use it for negative things,

00:27:17.970 --> 00:27:19.280
to be hurtful to other people

00:27:19.280 --> 00:27:22.680
or to worry about I took
to play out your identity.

00:27:22.680 --> 00:27:23.610
It can be challenging.

00:27:23.610 --> 00:27:27.000
It's an ongoing effort for me as a parent.

00:27:27.000 --> 00:27:31.660
But I think we have a huge role

00:27:31.660 --> 00:27:32.660
and you have a huge role

00:27:32.660 --> 00:27:36.230
in educating our own kids
about it first and foremost.

00:27:36.230 --> 00:27:37.240
Setting a good role.

00:27:37.240 --> 00:27:38.073
I would say that the parents

00:27:38.073 --> 00:27:39.000
are the number one thing you do

00:27:39.000 --> 00:27:40.930
is try to be a good role model right.

00:27:40.930 --> 00:27:42.900
You have to model that for your goods.

00:27:42.900 --> 00:27:44.680
If you're bullying other people online

00:27:44.680 --> 00:27:46.180
or on a social media platform

00:27:46.180 --> 00:27:48.380
or texting nasty things to people,

00:27:48.380 --> 00:27:51.193
even as an adult cause adults
do that, that's not good.

00:27:52.407 --> 00:27:54.330
But this is the world we live in.

00:27:54.330 --> 00:27:55.740
I'm glad I didn't grow up with him.

